SCOPE

This MIT License covers the software portions of the MACROBRUTE project:

  - firmware/pico/                    (Pico WH MicroPython firmware)
  - firmware/lpc2361/                 (LPC2361 ARM7 C firmware skeleton)
  - tools/                            (build, flash, RE, and analysis scripts)
  - docs/                             (documentation, build plan, research)

The hardware designs (schematics/, kicad/, panel/, and physical BOM content)
are licensed separately under CERN-OHL-S-2.0 — see LICENSE-HARDWARE.

